{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>And now go, lead the people.</b> Return to your leadership." "<b>Behold, My angel shall go.</b> As I said in the portion of Mishpatim: 'הנה אנכי שולח מלאך' (behold, I send an angel)." "<b>And on the day of My visitation and I will visit.</b> As long as they do not add further sin, I do not exact punishment from them; but if they add further sin, when I visit upon them the sin they commit, I will visit also this one along with it."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:36.871674582Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}